Dependencies
------------

- github.com/cB-Sigma/knx (Apache-2.0, Copyright 2026 Abhinav Gautam):
  the frames, KNX IP Secure primitives and zip encryption the simulator
  is built on.
- The Go standard library (BSD-3-Clause, Copyright The Go Authors).

Interop test peers (interop/, not part of the module's packages)
------------------------------------------------------------------

The nested test-only module interop/ runs xknx 3.20.0
(github.com/XKNX/xknx, MIT) and xknxproject 3.10.0
(github.com/XKNX/xknxproject, GPL-2.0-only), installed from PyPI in a
Docker container built on the tester's machine. interop/xknx/client.py,
which drives them, is ours (Apache-2.0). None of their code is included
in this repository or linked into the module.

Trademarks
----------

KNX and ETS are trademarks of the KNX Association cvba. They are used
here only to name the protocol and the file formats the simulator
produces. This project is not affiliated with, certified, sponsored or
endorsed by the KNX Association. The simulated files say "ETS" in their
CreatedBy attributes because readers expect it; they were not written by
ETS.

Test data
---------

Every password, key, serial number and address in this module is a
made-up demo value; none belongs to a real installation.
